{"id":"8c3be7e8c8cc164e","group":"28","path":"28/28-lem-permanent-cycle-cover.md","title":"Permanent Equals Weighted Cycle-Cover Sum","display":"lem-permanent-cycle-cover — Permanent Equals Weighted Cycle-Cover Sum","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-lem-permanent-cycle-cover","aliases":["28-lem-permanent-cycle-cover"],"display":"lem-permanent-cycle-cover — Permanent Equals Weighted Cycle-Cover Sum","depends_on":["[[28-df-cycle-cover]]","[[28-df-permanent]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §17.3.1, permanent/cycle-cover correspondence","source_printed_pages":"347–348","source_pdf_pages":"373–374","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-lem-permanent-cycle-cover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-lem-permanent-cycle-cover</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-permanent-cycle-cover — Permanent Equals Weighted Cycle-Cover Sum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"18ba781019fc626c\" href=\"?note=18ba781019fc626c\" title=\"28-df-cycle-cover\">28-df-cycle-cover</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e615e30a04aee2ed\" href=\"?note=e615e30a04aee2ed\" title=\"28-df-permanent\">28-df-permanent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §17.3.1, permanent/cycle-cover correspondence"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"347–348"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"373–374"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq[n]\\times[n]\">\\(E\\subseteq[n]\\times[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=([n],E)\">\\(G=([n],E)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w:E\\to R\">\\(w:E\\to R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为交换含幺环；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{CC},W_w\">\\(\\mathcal{CC},W_w\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"18ba781019fc626c\" href=\"?note=18ba781019fc626c\" title=\"28-df-cycle-cover\">28-df-cycle-cover</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{perm}\">\\(\\operatorname{perm}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e615e30a04aee2ed\" href=\"?note=e615e30a04aee2ed\" title=\"28-df-permanent\">28-df-permanent</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in R^{n\\times n}\">\\(A\\in R^{n\\times n}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_{ij}=w(i,j)\">\\(a_{ij}=w(i,j)\\)</span> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i,j)\\in E\">\\((i,j)\\in E\\)</span>，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_{ij}=0_R\">\\(a_{ij}=0_R\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{perm}_n(A)=\\sum_{F\\in\\mathcal{CC}(G)}W_w(F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{perm}_n(A)=\\sum_{F\\in\\mathcal{CC}(G)}W_w(F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[R=\\mathbb Z\\land\\forall e\\in E\\ w(e)=1]\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{perm}_n(A)=|\\mathcal{CC}(G)|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[R=\\mathbb Z\\land\\forall e\\in E\\ w(e)=1]\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{perm}_n(A)=|\\mathcal{CC}(G)|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>排列σ对应边集{(i,σ(i))}，每点入出度1；反之每个覆盖唯一决定排列。含缺失边的排列项权重0，其余项正好是覆盖权重。整数单位权实例每项1，故为覆盖数。环特征不为零时不能将计数等式误解成未取模自然数。</p>\n<p>来源：§17.3.1, permanent/cycle-cover correspondence；印刷页 347–348；PDF 页 373–374。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第17章的 Permanent Equals Weighted Cycle-Cover Sum，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-cycle-cover","status":"resolved","id":"18ba781019fc626c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-cycle-cover]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-permanent","status":"resolved","id":"e615e30a04aee2ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-permanent]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-cycle-cover","status":"resolved","id":"18ba781019fc626c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$E\\subseteq[n]\\times[n]$，$G=([n],E)$，$w:E\\to R$，$R$ 为交换含幺环；$\\mathcal{CC},W_w$ 见 [[28-df-cycle-cover]]，$\\operatorname{perm}$ 见 [[28-df-permanent]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-permanent","status":"resolved","id":"e615e30a04aee2ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$E\\subseteq[n]\\times[n]$，$G=([n],E)$，$w:E\\to R$，$R$ 为交换含幺环；$\\mathcal{CC},W_w$ 见 